id = "roswell_fragment"
title = "Roswell Debris Fragment — Sample 7"
category = "Material Evidence"
series = "Roswell Retrieval"
volume = 1
lore_blurb = "Bismuth-magnesium-zinc alloy, layered in alternating sheets at 15-nanometer intervals across a depth of 4.2 millimeters. The layering precision exceeds the manufacturing capability of any known facility — in 1947, or now.\n\nThe fragment is cold to the touch regardless of ambient temperature. Thermal imaging shows it maintains an internal temperature of exactly 4.7°C without any power source. It has maintained this temperature for 79 years.\n\nSample 7 of 23 from the primary debris field. Samples 1–6 and 8–23 are listed in the inventory under a different classification track. They are not accessible from this terminal. When you requested access, the AI Oversight system flagged your clearance level as 'insufficient — pending review.' You did not submit a review request."
